# Required for measurement sweeps only. The harness builds, typechecks, and runs
# its full test suite with no key set — see README "Running it without spending anything".
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional. Read by the agent itself (vendor/ticket-triage-agent/src/agent.ts),
# not by this harness. Defaults to claude-sonnet-4-6 when unset.
# CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6
